tempora.logger.setting.nbt_blocks.on=Saves what is inside blocks and their settings (NBT).
tempora.logger.setting.nbt_blocks.off=Doesn't save what is inside blocks (NBT is off).
tempora.logger.setting.nbt_items.on=Saves item NBT, such as enchantments and contents.
tempora.logger.setting.nbt_items.off=Doesn't save item NBT (NBT is off).
tempora.logger.setting.interval=Records every %s.
tempora.logger.setting.retention=Keeps events for %s.
